  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capital Investment Programme for Resilient Economic Growth (CIPREG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capital Infrastructure to assist Government of Montserrat in managing capital projects including New Montserrat National Hospital, aid is channelled through the Government to deliver ODA projects. Other projects include infrastructure to improve local transportation, all time access (airport runway resurfacing), health services&#x2019; infrastructure, internet connectivity and accommodation for the marginalised groups.</narrative>
  </description>
